e28†Fiber Optic Cables L71: \nL72:     * cite29†Flat Flex Cables (FFC, FPC) L73: \nL74:     * cite30†Multiple Conductor Cables L75: \nL76:     * cite31†Single Conductor Cables (Hook-Up Wire) L77: \nL78:     * cite27†View All L79: \nL80:   * cite32†Circuit Protection L81: \nL82:     * cite33†Circuit breaker accessories L83: \nL84:     * cite34†Circuit Breakers L85: \nL86:     * cite35†Circuit Protection Accessories L87: \nL88:     * cite36†Electrical, Specialty Fuses L89: \nL90:     * cite37†Fuseholders L91: \nL92:     * cite38†Fuses L93:     * cite39†Gas Discharge Tube Arresters (GDT) L94: \nL95:     * cite40†Inrush Current Limiters (ICL) L96: \nL97:     * cite41†PTC Resettable Fuses L98: \nL99:     * cite42†Surge Suppression ICs L100: \nL101:     * cite43†Thermal Cutoffs (Thermal Fuses) L102: \nL103:     * cite44†Transient Voltage Suppressors (TVS) L104: \nL105:       * cite45†Mixed Technology L106: \nL107:       * cite46†Surge Protection Devices (SPDs) L108: \nL109:       * cite47†Thyristors L110: \nL111:       * cite48†TVS Diodes L112: \nL1333: cite597†Notice cite598†1. EU Packaging and Packaging Waste Regulation (PPWR) cite599†2. New EU Import Regulations for Low-Value Goods (Effective 2026) cite600†3. Fuel Surcharge Adjustment – Logistics Rate Update Effective April 14, 2026 cite601†4. Cancellation of $15 Shipping Coupon cite602†5. Announcement: Updates to LCSC Product Categories cite603†6. Conflict in Ukraine cite604†7. LCSC Warehouse Relocation Notice cite605†8. LCSC Custom Cables Service is Launching L1334: \nL1335: cite606†Warranty Policy L1336: \nL1337: cite607†LCSC Information L1338: cite608†Coupons & Promotions L1339: \nL1340: cite609†Custom Cables L1341: \nL1342: cite610†Front Panels L1343: \nL1344: cite611†PCB & PCBA L1345: # New EU Import Regulations for Low-Value Goods (Effective 2026)\nL1346: \nL1347: * * *\nL1348: \nL1349: Last Modified: June 17, 2026\nL1350: What is changing?\nL1351: \nL1352: Starting July 1, 2026, the European Union (EU) will implement new customs regulations affecting low-value imported goods.\nL1353: \nL1354: Related links:\nL1355: \nL1356: DHL: cite612†Customs Regulatory Updates | DHL Express†mydhl.express.dhl L1357: \nL1358: FedEx: Scroll down to the section \"Shipping Regulatory Update\" on cite613†FedEx.com†www.fedex.com L1359: \nL1360: UPS: cite614†EU Customs Changes: How to Prepare | PDF†assets.ups.com L1361: \nL1362: -\nL1363: What are “low-value goods”?\nL1364: \nL1365: Goods with a declared value of €150 or below, typically B2C e-commerce shipments.\nL1366: \nL1367: -\nL1368: \nL1369: What are the key changes?\nL1370: \nL1371:   * Removal of duty exemption for low-value goods\nL1372:   * Introduction of a customs duty on B2C shipments ≤ €150\nL1373:   * Mandatory provision of detailed product identification data\nL1374: \nL1375: -\nL1376: \nL1377: Will all low-value shipments be taxed?\nL1378: \nL1379: Yes. The previous duty exemption will be removed, meaning all shipments are subject to customs duties.\nL1380: \nL1381: -\nL1382: \nL1383: Is the duty fixed?\nL1384: No, EU tax is charged per category and applies to B2C shipments valued ≤ €150, but this may be subject to future regulatory updates.\nL1385: \nL1386: Charging standard: €3 per first-level category on the parcel.\nL1387: \nL1388: For Example:\nL1389: Single category: The parcel contains 3 items, all of which belong to the same first-level category, for a total cost of €3.\nL1390: Cross-category: The parcel contains 2 items, belonging to 2 different first-level categories, for a total cost of €6 (€3 x 2).\nL1391: \nL1392: -\nL1393: \nL1394: Does VAT still apply?\nL1395: Yes. Value Added Tax (VAT) remains applicable in addition to the new duty.\nL1396: \nL1397: -\nL1398: \nL1399: What product information is required?\nL1400: \nL1401: The following product identifiers must be provided:\nL1402: \nL1403:   * Merchant Product ID\nL1404:   * Non-standard Manufacturer Product ID\nL1405:   * Standard Manufacturer Product ID (if available)\nL1406: \nL1407: -\nL1408: \nL1409: When must these identifiers be provided?\nL1410: \nL1411:   * Recommended: Start providing from July 1, 2026\nL1412:   * Mandatory enforcement: November 1, 2026\nL1413: \nL1414: -\nL1415: \nL1416: What happens if the data is incomplete or missing?\nL1417: \nL1418: Shipments may experience:\nL1419:   * Customs clearance delays\nL1420:   * Shipment holds or rejections\nL1421:   * Delivery failures\nL1422:   * Customers not receiving their goods\nL1423: \nL1424: Information\nL1425: \nL1426: cite615†About LCSC L1427: \nL1428: cite616†Contact Us L1429: \nL1430: cite617†LCSC Seller L1431: \nL1432: cite618†Quality Assurance†assets.lcsc.com L1433: \nL1434: cite619†Terms and Conditions L1435: \nL1436: cite620†Privacy Policy L1437: \nL1438: cite621†Cookie Notice L1439: \nL1440: cite622†Blog L1441: \nL1442: Tools\nL1443: \nL1444: cite623†BOM Tool/RFQ L1445: \nL1446: cite624†API L1447: \nL1448: cite625†LCSC Calculator Hub L1449: \nL1450: cite626†Cross Reference L1451: \nL1452: Customer Service\nL1453: \nL1454: cite627†Track Order L1455: \nL1456: cite596†Return Policy L1457: \nL1458: cite628†How to Checkout L1459: cite629†Orders & Payment Terms L1460: \nL1461: cite593†International Shipping L1462: \nL1463: Feedback\nL1464: \nL1465: cite630†FAQ L1466: \nL1467: cite630†Help Center L1468: \nL1469: Electronic Components\nL1470: \nL1471: cite631†EasyEDA†easyeda.com L1472: \nL1473: cite632†JLCPCB†jlcpcb.com L1474: \nL1475: cite633†LCSC L1476: \nL1477: cite216†CUSTOM CABLES†lcsccable.com L1478: \nL1479: cite634†FRONT PANELS L1480: \nL1481: Connect With Us\nL1482: \nL1483: Customer Service: 0086-755-83210457\nL1484: \nL1485: Logistics Dept.: 0086-755-83233027\nL1486: \nL1487: Email: support@lcsc.com\nL1488: \nL1489: 9:30 am - 12 am, 1:30 pm - 10 pm\nL14